# KSV-0118: deploy/gcp/job.yaml — "default security context allows root".
# This is a Cloud Run Job (run.googleapis.com), where the platform sandboxes
# each container and does not honor a raw-Kubernetes securityContext the same
# way; adding runAsNonRoot would require a matching non-root USER in the runner
# image and re-validating the end-to-end Cloud Run deploy. Tracked as a deploy
# hardening follow-up in ROADMAP rather than changed blind here.
